\": \"init-time-decoder\", \"concept\": \"Config decoded in .init_array constructor / TLS callback / DllMain\", \"priority\": 3, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"BUILT (prebuild-state ok). Fixture with __attribute__((constructor)) decoding a stored blob; extractor finds .init_array targets and emulates them with unicorn (stdlib-free). Low until a day theme hints at runtime ...\"},\n  {\"id\": \"shared-object-relocatable\", \"concept\": \"ET_DYN .so / ET_REL .o / DLL members\", \"priority\": 3, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"BUILT (prebuild-state ok). gcc -shared and gcc -c fixtures with .hcfg; expected elf_type ET_DYN/ET_REL, entry_point 0x0 for .o, exported-symbol config. PE DLL via objdump -p export ...\"},\n  {\"id\": \"exotic-codecs\", \"concept\": \"base58/base62/base91/z85 and lz4/zstd/brotli HCFG\", \"priority\": 3, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"BUILT (prebuild-state ok). tools/pybase62 + tools/pybase91 + python lz4 exist; pip install zstandard brotli into the venv. Add hcfg_fixtures entries with speculative offset = first stored ...\"},\n  {\"id\": \"direct-syscall-facts\", \"concept\": \"APIs invoked by raw `syscall` instructions instead of imports (static/no-libc binaries): syscall numbers -> names -> intent\", \"priority\": 3, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"An 'API intent' / 'prove no injection' sequel can hide process_vm_writev (310), ptrace (101), memfd_create (319), execve (59) behind inline syscalls. Extractor: capstone scan for `syscall` (x86-64) / `svc #0` (AArch64) / `int 0x80` (i386), backward-resolve the eax/x8 immediate, map with the x86-64/aarch64/i386 syscall tables (embed as dicts), feed api-intent-injection-classifier. Fixtures: gcc -nostdlib -static C with inline asm syscalls.\"},\n  {\"id\": \"lisp-scheme-member\", \"concept\": \"Lisp-family native images as a new-day member: SBCL core-embedded executable, Chicken Scheme (csc), Racket `raco exe`, ECL\", \"priority\": 3, \"action\": \"prebuild\", \"detail\": \"Remaining 'unusual runtime' languages after Haskell/OCaml/Fortran. Cues: SBCL huge static ELF with `SBCL` + core appended (`\\\\x00\\\\x00\\\\x00\\\\x00CORE` magic / `--core` strings, `sb-impl::`), Chicken `C_toplevel`, `libchicken.so.11`, `C_` symbols, Racket `.rackboot` section / `racket/base` strings, ECL `libecl.so`. HCFG likely a string literal (raw or base64) inside a heap image: raw/base64 scan must still work; offsets = first stored byte. Build fixtures only if the compilers are apt-installable (`apt-cache policy sbcl chicken-bin racket ecl`).\"}\n]\n```\n","numLines":246,"startLine":1,"totalLines":246}},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01NBEzUqC3Z7arDCDqJhdBKC","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
